1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:05,880
Two Friends

2
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:21,240
Thanh and Men are friends since childhood, when Thanh's house lived at Men's house.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:39,510
Later, Thanh moved to live in town.

4
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:52,860
Summer vacation, Thanh's father invites Men to town to play.

5
00:00:54,080 --> 00:01:03,310
Thanh takes Men to park to play.

6
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:16,620
While standing playing by lake, two friends suddenly hear cry for help of little children.

7
00:01:18,130 --> 00:01:28,950
Men rushes down lake to save a little child struggling sinking.

8
00:01:29,930 --> 00:01:41,570
Just a moment Men reaches beside boy, skillfully grabs hair, brings to shore.

9
00:01:44,970 --> 00:01:51,750
Thanh admires Men very much.

10
00:01:54,530 --> 00:02:06,680
Hearing this, father says everyone in Men's hometown are kind like that.

